# Public newsletter feed

You can now publish selected parts of your sent newsletters through a [public feed (Atom)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atom_(web_standard)), for example to reuse that content on your website. Member-specific data is never included.

The feed is enabled from a [newsletter template](/newsletter_templates). After each send, the last 10 published issues appear there. Drafts and scheduled newsletters stay private, and past issues are not added automatically.

More details in [the newsletters handbook](/handbook/newsletters#feed).
